{title: Teri Galiyon Me Na Rakhenge Kadam}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Usha Khanna}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E],        Teri galiyon mein na
[B],        rakhenge kadam
[A] [E],        aaj ke baad
[E],        tere milne ko na
[B],        ayenge sanam
[A] [E],        aaj ke baad
[Am] [E],        Tu mera milna samaj
[A],        lena ik sapna tha
[B],        tujko ab mil hi gaya
[E],        jo tera apna tha
[E],        hum ko duniya mein
[B],        samajna na sanam
[A] [E],        aaj ke baad
[Am] [E],        Ghirke ayegi ghataein
[A],        phirse sawam ki
[B],        tum toh bahon mein rahogi
[E],        apne sajan ki
[E],        galey hum ghum ko
[B],        lagayenge sanam
[A] [E],        aaj ke baad
